    "custom_liquid_cqKTNy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"jlr-reviews-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"jlr-heading\">\n    What our <span class=\"jlr-highlight\">customers</span> say\n  </h2>\n  <div class=\"jlr-tag-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"jlr-demo-tag\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"jlr-grid\">\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <div class=\"jlr-avatar\">RK</div>\n        <div class=\"jlr-person\">\n          <span class=\"jlr-name\">Rania K.</span>\n          <span class=\"jlr-location\">Beirut</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        With Beirut humidity I was scared it would feel heavy, but it's super light. A bit tacky for a minute, then my skin just feels soft and plump.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <div class=\"jlr-avatar\">MH</div>\n        <div class=\"jlr-person\">\n          <span class=\"jlr-name\">Maya H.</span>\n          <span class=\"jlr-location\">Saida</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        After a month the dry patches on my cheeks are gone. My mom stole the bottle and now she wants her own!\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <div class=\"jlr-avatar\">KS</div>\n        <div class=\"jlr-person\">\n          <span class=\"jlr-name\">Karim S.</span>\n          <span class=\"jlr-location\">Jounieh</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★☆</span>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        I use it after shaving. No sting, no smell, absorbs fast. Only wish the bottle was bigger.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <div class=\"jlr-avatar\">NA</div>\n        <div class=\"jlr-person\">\n          <span class=\"jlr-name\">Nour A.</span>\n          <span class=\"jlr-location\">Tripoli</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        Makeup sits so much smoother on top of it, and it layers well under my sunscreen. Yalla, it's part of my routine now.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <div class=\"jlr-avatar\">LN</div>\n        <div class=\"jlr-person\">\n          <span class=\"jlr-name\">Lara N.</span>\n          <span class=\"jlr-location\">Zahle</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        Bekaa winters dry my skin out badly. Two weeks in, my face finally feels comfortable again.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <div class=\"jlr-avatar\">JM</div>\n        <div class=\"jlr-person\">\n          <span class=\"jlr-name\">Joelle M.</span>\n          <span class=\"jlr-location\">Byblos</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        A few drops morning and night and my skin looks brighter and more even. A little goes a long way.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .jlr-reviews-section {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n  }\n  .jlr-reviews-section * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  .jlr-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .jlr-highlight {\n    background: #cf9d3f;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-tag-wrap { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n  .jlr-demo-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #8a6420;\n    background: #f6ecd9;\n    border: 1px solid #e6d2a8;\n    padding: 5px 12px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .jlr-card {\n    background: #f5f5f4;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    min-width: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .jlr-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .jlr-avatar {\n    width: 42px; height: 42px; flex-shrink: 0;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #cf9d3f; color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .jlr-person { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }\n  .jlr-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; }\n  .jlr-location { font-size: 12px; color: #6b6b6b; }\n  .jlr-stars { color: #cf9d3f; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .jlr-text {\n    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0; overflow-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .jlr-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .jlr-heading { font-size: 22px; }\n    .jlr-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; }\n    .jlr-card { padding: 16px; }\n    .jlr-text { font-size: 12.5px; }\n  }\n</style>",
